# armour/shared/pauldron_flame6_r: the legend FLAME pauldron on the right shoulder (flame.6; FORGE-MANTLE, the envelope: PLAN "The envelope", STYLE_P2 29).
# tongues of flame licking up off a banded cop, the tallest 4 px over it curling outward, two smaller beside it;
# a rim and a lame under the band (the Mythic's legend size).
# 6 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (28 across with its pair); the side views the large
# size's width + 1, hanging lower. Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the rims, G the tongues' hearts, N the seam under the band, P the tongues and the band.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by FORGE-MANTLE gen56.py from shapes56.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron flame.6
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
